{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人离开了一段让自己反复受委屈的关系或处境，却始终怀念那里曾经给予自己的亲近、接纳和归属感，因此在愤怒、思念、孤独和想回头之间反复摇摆。最后他承认自己受过的伤不该忍，决定带着对孤单的担心继续往前，也希望未来再遇到真正接纳自己的人时，能够好好珍惜那份亲近。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"离开后仍然迷惘\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"舍不得却提醒自己离开\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"怀念被接纳的温暖\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"旧日亲近令人犹疑\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"抗争耗尽只剩疲惫\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"受伤仍渴望亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"安心被惊醒仍怕受伤\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"旧日温柔短暂回返\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"想回去却不知为何\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"最怀念被接纳\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"害怕仍迈步向前\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"承认受伤并决定前行\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"珍惜未来真诚亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是S03，停留时间只有38秒，却出现大量怀念、愤怒、焦躁、轻松等交错情绪，很难迅速理清；S09和S10也让人一时无法确定他究竟想回到过去，还是只是害怕孤单。最抓人的是S06到S13，母亲的哼歌、故乡的记忆和不必防备的亲近感反复出现，最后落到一个很能理解的选择：不再忍受伤害，但也不因此放弃对真正亲近的期待。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "29874256-59b9-443b-8e21-64e7bacac77a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193033501262Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:31:27.147251+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "126a8289ec3c9a33ff61f085a044453982643ac9a66095ab39aa4a4a2a7cb0c7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193033501262Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4b7d5e9d8fd7f512eff7402c3f1619d85fedaec71d88c8785ee93a3742ceafaf"}}}
